WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.670
The Managed Strategy desk is where PAMM managers operate.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:12.700
Create a program, connect its master account, and monitor NAV, investors and risk from one screen.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:24.083
In the Strategy Profile panel you assign one of the four registered strategies: Sniper, Scalper, Fast Scalp or Nitro Scalper, together with a risk profile.

00:00:24.083 --> 00:00:31.500
The assignment pins the exact strategy version and hash, so live money never runs on a moving target.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:44.506
Before real capital, the combination must earn its certification: replay, shadow, demo and canary stages, each with hard evidence gates and a tamper-evident audit chain.

00:00:44.506 --> 00:00:47.200
Only a certified combo can go live.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:57.375
Once live, the execution guard checks every single order against the assignment, the certification and the strictest risk envelope.

00:00:57.375 --> 00:01:00.559
If anything drifts, trading fails closed.

00:01:00.559 --> 00:01:03.200
That is managed money done safely.
